          "text": "1. RUN = move fast on foot",
          "voice_line": "<break time=\"0.3s\"/> Meaning one — the one you know: to <emphasis level=\"strong\">move fast</emphasis> on foot. I run every morning. She ran to catch the bus. <emphasis level=\"strong\">Run!</emphasis> We are late. This is the basic one.",
